; ===========================================================================
; ARTEFACT STATS (by rarity tier list). Only ASCII comments here!
;
; Overrides of vanilla sections, written as "![Name]" (the bang goes BEFORE the
; bracket). An override EXTENDS the section: it replaces only the keys it names,
; all other vanilla values stay. That is why EVERY stat is listed here, zeros
; included - otherwise vanilla values (Snowflake power 0.003, Eye bleeding
; 0.004) would remain and stack with ours.
;
; Radiation by rarity: tier 1 +11 (0.011), tier 2 +6 (0.006),
; tier 3 +3 (0.003), unique +15 (0.015).
;
; Protection lives ONLY in the *_absorbation tables, and also completely.
; ===========================================================================

